                  "name": "Playa Pinitos",
                  "text": "Tucked along the picturesque coast of Mazatlan, Playa Pinitos is a delightful seaside retreat. The shoreline exudes a comfortable and intimate atmosphere, perfect for visitors looking to avoid massive crowds. This beach is wonderful for a gentle swim, finding seashells, and soaking up the Pacific sunshine. It is a fantastic spot to simply bring a towel and unwind for a few hours.",
